<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-BANK UMUM FIRST HALF NET UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BANK UMUM FIRST HALF NET UP.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		  (in billion rupiah except per share numbers)</p>
<p>    Net profit			40.29	  vs    28.73</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rph)	128	  vs	157</p>
<p>    Net interest income	   109.23	 vs    99.72</p>
<p>    Other operating income	 46.13	 vs    30.73</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   46.96	 vs    42.14</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     213.21	 vs   157.05</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Bank Umum Nasional is a large privately-owned bank.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
